 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-06","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.23","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.23/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"84972130ff0b9e02bceac1ba6d332f02ff5065851a22d5f85a4b002424473b83"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.23/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"a0dd63696bc827a3da120937e6832929ad1c0b4332ce1da4c47a07545738553f"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.23/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"97c772a1dfdc6d4edee9423449af886007d6b807df0b8910666b376739a9a276"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.23/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"5f6e39340bacce19b6c42942fb5097c3a222e31213eb129e77b48fe75d575245"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.23"}